OL,3,ATwo killed in Houthi attack on airport
OL,4,Ain eastern Saudi Arabia, authorities
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FYemen's Houthi movement has said it
OL,8,Fcarried out an attack on an airport in
OL,9,Feastern Saudi Arabia on Wednesday
OL,10,Fevening, which Saudi authorities said
OL,11,Fkilled two people and injured eight
OL,12,Fothers.
OL,14,FThe Saudi General Authority of Civil
OL,15,FAviation identified those killed at
OL,16,FKing Fahd International Airport in
OL,17,FDammam as a Saudi citizen and an Indian
OL,18,Fresident.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
