OL,3,ATwo killed in Houthi attack on airport
OL,4,Ain eastern Saudi Arabia, authorities
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt did not say what type of attack
OL,8,Foccurred, but the Iran-backed Houthis
OL,9,Fsaid on Thursday that the airport was
OL,10,Fone of the sites they had targeted with
OL,11,Fdrones and missiles over the previous
OL,12,F48 hours.
OL,14,FTwo more people were killed on
OL,15,FWednesday morning by debris from a
OL,16,Fdrone that was intercepted elsewhere in
OL,17,FEastern Province, the Saudi energy
OL,18,Fministry said.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
